<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Aug industrial output up 1.8 pct y/y-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish Aug industrial output up 1.8 pct y/y-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial output fell seasonally-adjusted 5.3 percent in August and was up 1.8 percent year-on-year, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Manufacturing production fell 6.0 percent over the month and was up 0.6 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>		     Manufacturing  Transportable    All industries</p>
